  m_text: "And in the end, I began to understand:\nPerhaps what I truly defeated
    wasn\u2019t the enemy,\nbut every thought that tried to make me stop moving.\nEvery
    doubt. Every hesitation.\nNot cut down with rage\u2014but passed through with
    resolve."
