  m_text: "What does it truly mean to move forward?\nAt first, I thought it meant
    cutting down whatever stood in my way\u2014those that looked dangerous, twisted,
    hostile.\nBut then the faces changed.\nSome were strange. Some looked harmless.\nSome
    weren\u2019t enemies at all\u2026 just there, existing."
